Z||000000||87 Steve GT||01-16-2000||09:21 AM||||Not really a hard question...  Where is the fuel regulator at on the 2.8 ??? I'm really new to all this engine stuff.. sorry if it seem's like a dumb  question  =(  ||||reg||5
Z||000001||Eric||01-16-2000||09:39 AM||||It's under the upper manifold and you can see it sitting on top of the fuel rail if you look from the left side of the engine compartment.  It looks like a small canister about an inch and a half in diameter, has a vacuum line sticking out of it and is painted black.||||reg||1
